WEBVTT

00:24.566 --> 00:27.777
MANATSU ATAGAWA

06:30.181 --> 06:32.183
PLOD, PLOD, PLOD

06:57.375 --> 06:59.168
I WAS TOO SCARED TO COMPLAIN

06:59.252 --> 07:00.711
YOU'RE TOO BLUNT, MIKI

07:00.795 --> 07:02.713
THE WAY YOU SAY THINGS IS HARSH

08:08.779 --> 08:09.989
TOUCHED...

08:10.072 --> 08:11.199
YEAH!

08:11.282 --> 08:12.116
CRUSH

09:55.052 --> 09:59.682
ORANGE JUICE, HOT CHOCOCOA,
STRAWBERRY MILK

10:09.358 --> 10:11.986
NOT THE REACTION I WAS EXPECTING...

11:02.078 --> 11:03.162
I WASN'T NECESSARILY HANGING MY
HEAD BECAUSE I WAS BOTHERED...

11:08.459 --> 11:10.378
ALL ALONE...

11:26.519 --> 11:28.813
TOUCHED...

12:58.277 --> 13:00.029
SCHOOL NURSE'S OFFICE

13:15.169 --> 13:22.176
RUMBLE, RUMBLE...

16:09.385 --> 16:12.596
I WANT TO EAT OUT WITH THE GIRLS
WHERE'S A GOOD PLACE TO GO?

16:35.953 --> 16:37.663
KITAMURA > KITAMU > MU > MUKO

16:39.206 --> 16:42.042
FRIENDLY ATMOSPHERE

17:39.892 --> 17:41.643
I'M A DELINQUENT...
I HAVE A TROUBLED PAST

17:41.727 --> 17:42.561
I DON'T WANT TO HANG
OUT WITH YOU

17:42.644 --> 17:43.479
GULP...

17:44.021 --> 17:45.522
I'm someone I made up.

17:56.450 --> 17:57.910
GRUNT

18:07.920 --> 18:09.922
INTENSE

18:10.047 --> 18:12.174
GAPING...

19:07.479 --> 19:09.064
GUSH

19:09.148 --> 19:10.732
FLUSTERED

19:23.745 --> 19:28.625
PANIC PANIC

20:02.743 --> 20:07.664
INTENSE

22:55.791 --> 22:56.792
WARM AND FUZZY...

22:56.875 --> 22:57.876
EUPHORIA

23:08.512 --> 23:09.763
SHAKE, SHAKE

23:21.191 --> 23:23.026
STEP, STEP, STEP, STEP

23:42.712 --> 23:45.966
THUMP, THUMP, THUMP

23:47.217 --> 23:49.469
THUMP, THUMP, THUMP
